    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1206">

                <pb facs="1206" n="920" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg920"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 872.48/71</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Sharp</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-04-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 29, 1916</hi>
                        </date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 12.05 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1375. For Red Cross:</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>Expect favorable decision material Marseille. Suggest no more material be
                        sent this way. French authorities to make special exception in this case.
                        They refuse on account blockade to allow further relief Serbia. Possibility
                        free transportation in France will be refused, although still hopeful.
                        Leaving for Berne about Monday to arrange further transportation.</p>
                    <p rendition="#right">
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ryan</hi>
                        
                    </p>
                </quote>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sharp</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
